- `client/components/explainers/where-small-business-owners-hang-out-online/LeavingTheFeed.tsx` is the new figure. It uses the site's colour variables and is styled like the existing figures.
- `client/components/explainers/registry.ts` registers it as `where-small-business-owners-hang-out-online/leaving-the-feed`.
- `client/content/posts/data/where-small-business-owners-hang-out-online.ts` places the explainer block with its alt text and caption.
